"Start segment" = "起始轨迹段";
"Start selected route" = "开始所选路线";
"System location restoration is not confirmed" = "尚未确认系统定位恢复";
"System reports a simulated fix" = "系统报告当前位置为模拟定位";
"The coordinate conversion did not converge. The original point was kept." = "坐标转换未能收敛，已保留原始位置。";
"The next segment may start far away. Continuing moves directly to its first point." = "下一段的起点可能相距较远。继续后将直接移动到该段的第一个点。";
"The offline coordinate coverage data is unavailable. Keep the standard coordinate setting." = "离线坐标覆盖数据不可用，请保持标准坐标设置。";
"The pairing advertisement failed. Check Local Network permission and try again after the native listener finishes." = "配对服务广播失败。请检查本地网络权限，等待底层监听结束后重试。";
"The request timed out. The native operation is still finishing; location restoration is not confirmed." = "请求已超时，底层操作仍在结束中，尚未确认定位已恢复。";
"The route stays paused after reconnecting. Continue when ready." = "重新连接后路线仍保持暂停。准备好后可继续。";
"This GPX contains multiple tracks or segments. Choose one in the route planner." = "此 GPX 包含多条轨迹或多个轨迹段，请在路线规划中选择。";
"This place already uses standard coordinates and cannot be corrected again." = "此地点已使用标准坐标，不能再次修正。";
"This point is outside the mainland coordinate coverage. Its coordinates were kept." = "此位置不在中国大陆坐标覆盖范围内，已保留原始坐标。";
"This prepares a map pin. Apply it from the map when ready." = "此操作将设置地图选点。准备好后可在地图中应用定位。";
"Track" = "轨迹";
"Track %d" = "轨迹 %d";
"Use the device endpoint configured by your loopback VPN, usually 10.7.0.1. A detected VPN interface does not prove the developer service is reachable." = "请使用回环 VPN 配置的设备地址，通常为 10.7.0.1。检测到 VPN 接口不代表可以访问开发者服务。";
"Use these coordinates" = "使用此坐标";
"VPN interface hint" = "VPN 接口检测";
"WGS84 (GPS / standard GPX)" = "WGS84（GPS／标准 GPX）";
"WGS84 coordinates" = "WGS84 坐标";
"Wait for the previous native operation to finish before trying again." = "请等待上一次底层操作结束后再重试。";
"Waiting for next segment" = "等待下一段";
"Waiting for the last position update…" = "正在等待最后一次位置更新…";
"Waypoint route" = "航点路线";
"Keep pairing active with silent audio" = "通过静音播放保持配对运行";
"Optional: play silent audio only while pairing in Settings. It stops when pairing finishes or is cancelled." = "可选：仅在切换到系统设置进行配对时播放静音。配对结束或取消后停止。";
"Next segment begins at %@, %.0f m from the current position." = "下一段起点为 %@，与当前位置相距约 %.0f 米。";
"Move to next segment?" = "移动到下一段？";
"Wait for the native pairing listener to finish before changing the simulation." = "请等待底层配对监听结束后，再更改定位模拟。";
"Enter valid route start and destination coordinates." = "请输入有效的路线起点和终点坐标。";
"The route could not be loaded because the network is unavailable. Check the connection and try again." = "网络不可用，无法加载路线。请检查连接后重试。";
"No road route is available between these points. Choose another start or destination." = "这些位置之间没有可用的道路路线，请更换起点或终点。";
"The map routing service is unavailable. Try again later or import a GPX route." = "地图路线规划服务暂不可用，请稍后重试或导入 GPX 路线。";
"The request timed out. The native worker has finished; retry or confirm location restoration." = "请求已超时，底层任务已结束。请重试或确认系统定位是否恢复。";
"Could not preserve the restoration record. Check the pairing file and tunnel IP before starting." = "无法保存恢复记录。开始前请检查配对文件和隧道 IP。";
"Location before simulation" = "模拟前的系统定位";
"Fresh system location after stopping" = "停止后的新系统定位";
"Accuracy: ±%.0f m" = "精度：±%.0f 米";
"The restoration record could not be read. Check the pairing file and restore the system location before starting." = "无法读取恢复记录。开始前请检查配对文件并恢复系统定位。";
"Preparing route…" = "正在准备路线…";
"Background location is optional. You can enable it with Always permission in Locus Settings to help pairing continue while switching to iOS Settings." = "后台定位为可选功能。可在 Locus 设置中开启并授予“始终”定位权限，帮助切换到 iOS 设置时维持配对。";
"The native pairing listener returned an invalid port." = "底层配对监听返回了无效端口。";
"The pairing connection failed. Check Local Network permission and try again after the native listener finishes." = "配对连接失败。请检查本地网络权限，等待底层监听结束后重试。";
